<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Expeditors Int'l raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Expeditors Int'l raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Monday it raised earnings estimates on Expeditors International of Washington Inc to $1.70 from $1.65 for 1996 and to $2.04 from $1.90 for 1997.</p>
<p>--Citing growth prospects and better confidence in near-term results, EVEREN analyst Kevin Silverman in a report said he also raised the six-month target price to $38 from $34 and the 18-month target price to $46 from $39.</p>
<p>--Expeditors was trading at 34-3/4, off 1.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
